WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 c5187b46923e87c2aac86912c90dfb53

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.140
Karibu tena. Natumaini sasa unajisikia huru zaidi na

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:06.810
orodha. Orodha ndiyo chaguo letu la kwanza

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:09.740
tunapokuwa na orodha ya kitu chochote. Orodha

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:11.560
ya wakufunzi, orodha ya alama, orodha

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:14.420
ya viambato. Orodha yoyote ile, unataka kutumia

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:17.630
orodha. Lakini kuna muundo mwingine wa data ambao

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:20.060
pia ni wa kawaida sana unapotaka kitu

00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:23.380
kilicho tata kidogo kuliko orodha. Fikiria

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:24.780
tunataka kuhifadhi taarifa kadhaa kunihusu:

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.580
jina langu, umri wangu, mahali nilipozaliwa.

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:30.140
Sasa, unaweza kutumia orodha kwa hilo,

00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:32.200
lakini haieleweki vizuri kinachoendelea

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:34.850
unapofanya hivyo. Je, England ni mahali

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:37.210
nilipozaliwa au ninapoishi? Je, 42 ni

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:40.120
umri wangu au kitu kingine? Na ikiwa nataka

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:42.050
kutumia hii, lazima nikumbuke kwamba

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:44.740
nafasi ya kwanza ni ya jina, ya pili

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:47.900
ni ya umri, ya tatu ni ya mahali nilipozaliwa.

00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:49.840
Yote haya ni mchafuko kidogo, na ni mchafuko

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:52.420
kwa sababu hii si orodha ya vitu hasa.

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:55.769
Ni tata zaidi ya hapo. Na hapo ndipo

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:58.500
dictionaries zinapoingia. Dictionary ni

00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:00.340
aina mpya ya muundo wa data. Huu ni muundo

00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:03.830
wako wa tano. Unayo strings, namba, Booleans, orodha, na

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:06.200
sasa dictionary. Na nataka ufikirie

00:01:06.260 --> 00:01:08.620
dictionary kama ukurasa wa

00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:12.180
daftari la spiral. Upande wa kushoto kuna

00:01:12.220 --> 00:01:15.460
vichwa vya habari, yaani maneno name, age, birthplace, na

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:18.400
haya tunayaita funguo. Na upande wa kulia,

00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:20.240
kando ya kila kichwa, una

00:01:20.300 --> 00:01:24.520
data halisi: Jeremy, 42, England, na haya

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:28.300
tunayaita thamani. Sasa, kama vile orodha,

00:01:28.340 --> 00:01:31.180
dictionary ni kitu kimoja. Ni ukurasa mmoja

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:33.830
wa daftari. Na kama vile orodha, Jiki anaweza

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:35.250
kuiweka kwenye variable, kwenye sanduku,

00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:37.930
au kama ingizo la kitendakazi, au

00:01:37.980 --> 00:01:39.540
anaweza kutoa dictionary kutoka kwenye

00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:42.200
mteremko wa matokeo. Basi, hivi ndivyo dictionary

00:01:42.260 --> 00:01:45.080
inavyoonekana kwenye msimbo. Tunatumia mabano yaliyopinda

00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:47.490
kuashiria mwanzo na mwisho, kisha

00:01:47.520 --> 00:01:49.420
ndani yake una jozi: funguo upande wa

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:51.700
kushoto, nukta mbili, kisha thamani upande

00:01:51.740 --> 00:01:53.860
wa kulia, na tunakuwa na koma kati ya

00:01:53.900 --> 00:01:56.260
kila jozi. Jiki anaona hivi, na

00:01:56.280 --> 00:01:58.600
anatoa daftari lake la spiral. Anaandika name,

00:01:58.960 --> 00:02:02.100
Jeremy, age, 42, na kadhalika kwa kila

00:02:02.140 --> 00:02:04.440
jozi. Na akimaliza, anang'oa

00:02:04.480 --> 00:02:06.320
ukurasa huo na kuuweka kwenye sanduku

00:02:06.420 --> 00:02:09.360
lililoandikwa person. Sasa, kuna sheria chache za

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:12.060
kujua. Funguo huwa ni strings kila wakati. Lazima ziwe na

00:02:12.140 --> 00:02:14.620
alama za nukuu pande zote, na kila funguo lazima

00:02:14.680 --> 00:02:18.170
iwe ya kipekee. Huwezi kuwa na funguo mbili

00:02:18.260 --> 00:02:21.420
zinazoitwa name katika dictionary moja. Thamani

00:02:21.480 --> 00:02:23.150
zinaweza kufanana ikiwa unataka,

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:25.810
lakini funguo lazima ziwe tofauti, na

00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:27.600
thamani zinaweza kuwa kitu chochote. Zinaweza kuwa

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:31.000
strings, namba, Booleans, orodha, au hata dictionary nyingine.

00:02:32.140 --> 00:02:34.540
Unaweza pia kuwa na dictionary tupu,

00:02:34.600 --> 00:02:37.220
kama tulivyokuwa na orodha tupu,

00:02:37.280 --> 00:02:38.800
na tunaweza kuanza na hiyo na

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:42.210
kuijenga baadaye. Sawa, sasa unayo

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:44.160
dictionary, lakini unawezaje kutoa kitu

00:02:44.220 --> 00:02:46.900
kutoka ndani yake? Tunatumia mabano

00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:48.960
ya mraba kama tulivyofanya na orodha na

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:52.980
strings, lakini badala ya namba ya nafasi,

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:55.040
tunaweka funguo. Kwa hiyo, ikiwa tunataka

00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:57.390
kutoa jina la mtu kutoka kwenye dictionary,

00:02:57.940 --> 00:03:01.620
tunaandika variable person, mabano ya mraba, na

00:03:01.640 --> 00:03:03.580
kisha funguo, hapa ni name, ndani ya

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:07.260
alama za nukuu. Na hiyo inamwambia Jiki aangalie

00:03:07.300 --> 00:03:09.970
kwenye dictionary ya person, atafute funguo ya

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:12.900
name, na atoe thamani yake. Jiki

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:15.000
anaenda kwenye sanduku la person, anatoa

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:17.340
ukurasa kutoka kwenye daftari, anapitia

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:19.760
funguo zote mpaka anapopata name, kisha anasoma

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:21.900
thamani, Jeremy, na kuiweka kwenye

00:03:21.910 --> 00:03:27.540
sanduku jipya liitwalo name. Mabano ya mraba daima

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:29.980
yanamaanisha kitu kimoja. Unaingia ndani ya kitu

00:03:29.990 --> 00:03:32.370
na kutoa kitu kutoka humo. Kwa orodha na strings,

00:03:32.960 --> 00:03:34.720
unatumia namba kusema ni nafasi gani

00:03:34.760 --> 00:03:37.580
unataka kutoa kitu. Kwa dictionary,

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:40.140
unatumia string kama funguo. Ni wazo

00:03:40.180 --> 00:03:43.340
lile lile, ila sintaksia ni tofauti kidogo. Sawa, sasa

00:03:43.380 --> 00:03:45.390
una mazoezi kadhaa ya kujizoeza

00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:47.640
kuunda dictionary na kusoma thamani kutoka ndani yake.

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:50.160
Kila unachohitaji ndicho tulichojifunza sasa hivi:

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:52.660
mabano yaliyopinda ya kuunda, mabano ya mraba

00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:55.200
ya kufikia. Chukua muda wako. Kila la

00:03:55.240 --> 00:03:56.820
heri, na tutaonana hapa tena hivi karibuni.
